  "prompt": "Which 3 products brought in the most net revenue? Use the sales table. Return three columns, in this order: product_id, product_name and revenue_eur, the total net_revenue_eur of that product. Sort by revenue_eur from highest to lowest; when products tie on revenue_eur, the lower product_id comes first. Return only the first 3 rows of that order. Order lines with a missing net_revenue_eur add nothing to the total. Do not round.",
